Error [E1117]: `task.all` branches must all be named or all positional.
  --> tests/ui/task_all_mixed_forms.jet:2:26
    |
  2 |     task.all { first: 1, 2 }
    |                          ^
 Why: D-CONC-ALLNAMED1=A gives named results stable record fields and keeps positional results as ordered lists; mixing the two shapes would make the result type ambiguous.
 Fix: Use `task.all { first: work(), second: other() }`, or remove every branch label.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1117
